    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;represent the work done in moving a particle from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> along three different paths <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> respectively (as shown) in the gravitational field of a point mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>. Find the correct relation between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0007534_Ques1_1.jpg\" />",
